iv data-rid="ff329bb8-f202-4846-82db-2ff49b751f8a" class="r-xdhr9q"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="presentation" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:auto;max-height:100%" class="r-1aoecnu" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M11.354 1.646a.5.5 0 0 1 0 .708L5.707 8l5.647 5.646a.5.5 0 0 1-.708.708l-6-6a.5.5 0 0 1 0-.708l6-6a.5.5 0 0 1 .708 0"></path></svg></div></button><div data-rid="671a8e4a-1e9e-4dfe-a9af-3b4247373fdb" class="r-ktfyom"><div data-rid="2671ef3c-3c43-414f-b82b-35786f078ae5" aria-current="true" aria-label="Go to slide 1" role="button" tabindex="0" class="r-wqp05s r-4i2axc"></div><div data-rid="2671ef3c-3c43-414f-b82b-35786f078ae5" aria-current="false" aria-label="Go to slide 2" role="button" tabindex="0" class="r-wqp05s"></div><div data-rid="2671ef3c-3c43-414f-b82b-35786f078ae5" aria-current="false" aria-label="Go to slide 3" role="button" tabindex="0" class="r-wqp05s"></div></div><button type="button" data-replo-component-root="carousel" data-replo-part="nav-button" data-direction="next" aria-label="Next slide" disabled="" data-rid="701b8649-7334-4b98-a338-e68ba8a07635" class="r-18urxbs r-12j74ts"><div data-rid="28198bd8-6fda-4c20-b8b2-8352bc37d9f9" class="r-6rewzb"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="presentation" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:auto;max-height:100%" class="r-w25y7p" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M4.646 1.646a.5.5 0 0 1 .708 0l6 6a.5.5 0 0 1 0 .708l-6 6a.5.5 0 0 1-.708-.708L10.293 8 4.646 2.354a.5.5 0 0 1 0-.708"></path></svg></div></button></div></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="9a8a42f1-de4c-4740-825c-4629cf66efec" class="r-pw4uw8"><div data-rid="f872e98b-dea6-4108-ab62-cdcc93d8de0c" class="r-15oxkoi"><div data-rid="85b30829-05f9-4c6b-89ec-14ac0fdb460d" class="r-1md0x33"><div data-rid="b12947c3-f926-48af-97b2-d4ebb0a32633" data-font-family="Symphony-Pro" class="r-1wmbmyj alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><h2>but will it <em>work</em> For my dog?</h2></span></div><div data-rid="2c6e8a98-c7fb-4d98-8b07-e53f8e704453" class="r-tby0sx alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Let's tackle the most common doubts we hear:</p></span></div></div><div data-rid="190d1372-16a4-454e-98b6-3b4fec4368bd" class="r-ex3ore"><div data-rid="4e194ad4-25f4-462f-a2dc-2735e1bb32fd" data-faq-border="" class="r-1wcxyhd" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="59cd65df-890b-4c70-89c9-83223785e106" class="r-ztbrsu" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="3826cd8b-b5dc-4f6f-adcc-4c4673c2f0e4" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R3nb2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-1t0uuj8"><div data-rid="0f688abc-567d-40cf-914a-c74f909cf618" class="r-1e85qjc alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Will my picky eater actually eat this?</p></span></div><div data-rid="0e30b4aa-e555-4d8e-a3cc-b304e56925a1" class="r-136vk3l"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:auto;max-height:100%" class="r-1853jnv" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M8 4a.5.5 0 0 1 .5.5v3h3a.5.5 0 0 1 0 1h-3v3a.5.5 0 0 1-1 0v-3h-3a.5.5 0 0 1 0-1h3v-3A.5.5 0 0 1 8 4"></path></svg></div></div><div hidden="" id="replo-:R3nb2:"><div data-rid="a477fc4a-fb78-4cc2-ae42-4067d3276aa1" class="r-naikqq"><div data-rid="bdbeb689-4b7d-4334-9326-2f9344a23af4" class="r-fbsi4x alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Yes. 94% of picky eaters devour Perfect Superfood on the first try.<br><br>Why? Because it's real meat with concentrated natural flavor from our air-drying process. No chemical "natural flavors" needed to trick dogs into eating.<br><br>We offer 3 protein options (meat, turkey, fish) so you can find what your dog loves. And if they don't eat it enthusiastically, our 7-day money-back guarantee covers you completely.<br><br>Most dogs transition immediately and never look back.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="53886d61-02b0-4670-89d9-a3930c0eb219" class="r-rhnuks" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="7f12a5ee-c413-4648-b7ac-b42205caa937" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R5nb2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-1judvpp"><div data-rid="df2d8ab1-5697-44ef-939d-eda3e3eb873f" class="r-1ua2n9x alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Is this safe without refrigeration?</p></span></div><div data-rid="b18d08dd-2dfb-4334-9737-359a0f65cc39" class="r-1aakbpg"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:auto;max-height:100%" class="r-mxe4og" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M8 4a.5.5 0 0 1 .5.5v3h3a.5.5 0 0 1 0 1h-3v3a.5.5 0 0 1-1 0v-3h-3a.5.5 0 0 1 0-1h3v-3A.5.5 0 0 1 8 4"></path></svg></div></div><div hidden="" id="replo-:R5nb2:"><div data-rid="49924909-f568-42f7-8975-33722cf807d0" class="r-1o2hc79"><div data-rid="bed6fd8e-a0f4-4eaa-9e07-a2d20485bf91" class="r-1lzxaeo alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Absolutely. Air-drying removes the moisture that bacteria needs to grow.<br><br></p><p>Combined with natural vitamin E (a natural preservative) and oxygen-absorber packaging, Perfect Superfood stays fresh for 6+ months unopened and 30 days after opening.<br><br></p><p>It's actually safer than fresh food, which can grow harmful bacteria if thawed improperly or left out too long.<br><br></p><p>Veterinarian-approved. Food safety tested. 100% safe for your dog.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="1bdcfdf5-8106-4911-ad44-a69a07bea2a9" class="r-um9i9b" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="9d275f16-9508-42f8-90be-bb149f9379ae" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R7nb2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-rizf2q"><div data-rid="1e87fb04-916c-43df-b7eb-7586e40ebe13" class="r-1uqdv3o alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>How do I transition my dog to this food?</p></span></div><div data-rid="94f341d8-cb1d-43d4-94b4-a07cae17b10e" class="r-kbqlwx"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:auto;max-height:100%" class="r-139nrps" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M8 4a.5.5 0 0 1 .5.5v3h3a.5.5 0 0 1 0 1h-3v3a.5.5 0 0 1-1 0v-3h-3a.5.5 0 0 1 0-1h3v-3A.5.5 0 0 1 8 4"></path></svg></div></div><div hidden="" id="replo-:R7nb2:"><div data-rid="32b99a97-e7cd-4b8f-adaf-b2440c28b764" class="r-1y2snt8"><div data-rid="7b23fad8-ce1a-4f57-990e-551bb960323c" data-text="list" class="r-1cp7fau alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Most dogs transition immediately without any digestive upset because there are no inflammatory oils or synthetic additives to trigger reactions.<br><br>If you prefer a gradual transition:<br></p><ul><li><p>Days 1-3: Mix 25% Yumwoof with 75% old food</p></li><li><p>Days 4-6: Mix 50/50</p></li><li><p>Days 7-9: Mix 75% Yumwoof with 25% old food</p></li><li><p>Day 10+: 100% Yumwoof</p></li></ul><p><br>But many dog parents switch cold turkey successfully because the food is so clean and digestible.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="7c71d05b-5603-4e69-bae8-aca6b511438d" class="r-a0xpuo" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="be0b4230-8ae2-46f6-b875-e3c65511091e" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R9nb2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-19w3b9p"><div data-rid="968e7f82-d6c9-4c94-9deb-b5c20378d46d" class="r-1it1xxt alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>What if my dog has allergies?</p></span></div><div data-rid="0c74aa0d-284c-4239-8ea2-858ff7cb2a8e" class="r-erykmt"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:auto;max-height:100%" class="r-1ujzsr9" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M8 4a.5.5 0 0 1 .5.5v3h3a.5.5 0 0 1 0 1h-3v3a.5.5 0 0 1-1 0v-3h-3a.5.5 0 0 1 0-1h3v-3A.5.5 0 0 1 8 4"></path></svg></div></div><div hidden="" id="replo-:R9nb2:"><div data-rid="2420cf78-1c31-4982-b02f-d1c8a0566371" class="r-5gand7"><div data-rid="036cbace-1e58-4423-a824-288b4f3fc8e5" data-text="list" class="r-ocb5qs alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Most "allergies" are actually inflammatory responses to seed oils and synthetic additives in dog food.<br><br>When you remove those triggers, the "allergies" often disappear completely within 2-4 weeks.<br><br>We offer 3 different protein options for dogs with specific protein sensitivities:<br></p><ul><li><p>Beef (most dogs)</p></li><li><p>Turkey (for beef-sensitive dogs)</p></li><li><p>Salmon (for poultry and beef allergies)</p></li></ul><p><br>Try it risk-free for 60 days. If your dog reacts negatively, we refund every penny.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="f57ea1c5-8e34-458b-a586-1f5fc2a2adb7" class="r-15d4oxl" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="4a971f45-333b-45bf-8a8c-b8a3f1e0d83b" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:Rbnb2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-10a6kil"><div data-rid="c032bdff-0211-4e44-ae75-9245e7e3be05" class="r-1wnsmto alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>How long until I see results?</p></span></div><div data-rid="ff202a64-c5dd-4367-8930-c7eb98dd857a" class="r-tqz85m"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:auto;max-height:100%" class="r-17s8l61" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M8 4a.5.5 0 0 1 .5.5v3h3a.5.5 0 0 1 0 1h-3v3a.5.5 0 0 1-1 0v-3h-3a.5.5 0 0 1 0-1h3v-3A.5.5 0 0 1 8 4"></path></svg></div></div><div hidden="" id="replo-:Rbnb2:"><div data-rid="5dd7e8e8-c28e-4d61-b4c3-5086a7786329" class="r-ggksc"><div data-rid="a448f332-8d62-4455-b930-fcd6bc07e402" class="r-9zdka5 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Most dog parents see visible improvements within 2-3 weeks:<br><br>Week 1-2: Scratching decreases 40-50%, digestion stabilizes Week 3-4: Coat starts shining, energy increases noticeably Week 6-8: Dramatic transformation - zero scratching, full coat shine, sustained high energy<br><br>Every dog is different. Some respond in days, others take 4-6 weeks.<br><br>You have 60 days to see the transformation. That's plenty of time.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="95f45a12-a035-4b47-947b-bb4692932f43" class="r-1nsx55h" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="6ea1d94b-3985-4f3e-9e5c-3af0b1b73a86" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:Rdnb2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-1dw5glv"><div data-rid="11679d44-b465-4b39-b0ac-a1f5e9bf2818" class="r-1yfuijs alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Can I use this as a topper or does it need to be 100% of their diet?</p></span></div><div data-rid="5e08beea-4794-4e62-8d0f-78bde63cc6e1" class="r-14e336m"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:auto;max-height:100%" class="r-1c90vgt" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M8 4a.5.5 0 0 1 .5.5v3h3a.5.5 0 0 1 0 1h-3v3a.5.5 0 0 1-1 0v-3h-3a.5.5 0 0 1 0-1h3v-3A.5.5 0 0 1 8 4"></path></svg></div></div><div hidden="" id="replo-:Rdnb2:"><div data-rid="905f2b4f-032c-4eea-bcac-67711cc304f7" class="r-rcpx8m"><div data-rid="8d081cfa-ae82-492f-8005-7dbd1394b85f" class="r-1i2ax6t alchemy-rte